WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Lie on your back, legs extended, arms a little away from the body, palms up.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Let the feet fall open and the whole body grow heavy.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Soften the face, jaw, and breath.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Rest in stillness, then slowly return when ready.
